      "sourceHash": "55114d8b7234515f",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face Optimum？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c99d62e2226c6284",
      "translationZh": "支持哪些 Transformers 架构？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6391e13c57ddfffc",
      "translationZh": "如何把 Transformers 模型（BERT）转换成 ONNX？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ff1257d106c90a9",
      "translationZh": "接下来做什么？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3109eb1e1e6cd28",
      "translationZh": "开始吧！🚀",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05c0140c68e487d7",
      "translationZh": "如果你有兴趣优化模型使其以最高效率运行，请看 🤗 Optimum 库。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b03711f0f566b94",
      "translationZh": "1. 什么是 ONNX？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0acce2c8435311f3",
      "translationZh": "ONNX（Open Neural Network eXchange，开放神经网络交换）是一个表示机器学习模型的开放标准和格式。ONNX 定义了一组通用算子和通用文件格式，用于表示各种框架（包括 PyTorch 和 TensorFlow）中的深度学习模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb0bf279e8181f4c",
      "translationZh": "伪 ONNX 计算图，用 NETRON 可视化",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9361a50da0a7f6db",
      "translationZh": "模型导出为 ONNX 格式时，这些算子被用来构建一个计算图（常称中间表示），它表示数据在神经网络中的流动。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73b23d0eccd8a060",
      "translationZh": "重要：ONNX 不是运行时。ONNX 只是表示形式，需要配合 ONNX Runtime 之类的运行时使用。受支持的加速器列表见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b6fbe7b0f98365d",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 进一步了解 ONNX。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d42ee253fb4c6bf7",
      "translationZh": "2. 什么是 Hugging Face Optimum？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3310ef1032bda69",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Optimum 是一个开源库，是 Hugging Face Transformers 的扩展，提供统一的性能优化工具 API，让在加速硬件上训练和运行模型达到最高效率，其中包括面向 Graphcore IPU 和 Habana Gaudi 优化性能的工具箱。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "693732baa22dcb58",
      "translationZh": "Optimum 可用于转换、量化、图优化、加速训练与推理，并支持 transformers pipelines。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98e95e74533aeccf",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个典型的开发者旅程，展示如何结合 Optimum 与 ONNX。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8887bd36d690e59c",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 进一步了解 Optimum",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9097f97ebd01ac51",
      "translationZh": "3. 支持哪些 Transformers 架构？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18205e05819b7f57",
      "translationZh": "全部受支持的 Transformers 架构列表见 Transformers 文档的 ONNX 部分。下面节选了最常用的、可转换为 ONNX 并用 Hugging Face Optimum 优化的架构：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
