    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b983e200bfbbf73",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 全部受支持的架构",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89df6e96819d431e",
      "translationZh": "4. 如何把 Transformers 模型（BERT）转换为 ONNX？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31e39504e9bd528d",
      "translationZh": "目前有三种方式把 Hugging Face Transformers 模型转换成 ONNX。本节你将学到如何用全部三种方法导出用于文本分类的 distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english——从低层 torch API 到最友好的 optimum 高层 API。每种方法的效果完全相同。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0bd856331ac64e63",
      "translationZh": "用 torch.onnx 导出（低层）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0d8b1be7e47ef1e",
      "translationZh": "torch.onnx 让你用 export 方法把模型检查点转换为 ONNX 计算图，但你需要提供很多值，如 input_names、dynamic_axes 等。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "090e8f5a4ee51b2d",
      "translationZh": "你首先需要安装一些依赖：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d18c8f875057f3a0",
      "translationZh": "用 export 导出我们的检查点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ddf4a0cc0fe934d4",
      "translationZh": "用 transformers.onnx 导出（中层）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc5b3ed267f01955",
      "translationZh": "transformers.onnx 让你借助配置对象把模型检查点转换为 ONNX 计算图，从而不必为 dynamic_axes 等提供复杂配置。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "090e8f5a4ee51b2d",
      "translationZh": "你首先需要安装一些依赖：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3d79cee8167b136",
      "translationZh": "用 transformers.onnx 导出我们的检查点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f5229542fd0abea5",
      "translationZh": "用 Optimum 导出（高层）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69dbc8de3644a321",
      "translationZh": "Optimum Inference 包含用 ORTModelForXxx 类把原生 Transformers 模型转换为 ONNX 的方法。要把你的 Transformers 模型转成 ONNX，只需给 from_pretrained() 方法传 from_transformers=True，模型就会被加载并借助底层的 transformers.onnx 包转换为 ONNX。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "090e8f5a4ee51b2d",
      "translationZh": "你首先需要安装一些依赖：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfc6b3bfa57d2705",
      "translationZh": "用 ORTModelForSequenceClassification 导出我们的检查点",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d027de090b50b8e3",
      "translationZh": "用 Optimum 转换最棒的一点是：你可以立即用这个模型跑预测，或把它装进 pipeline。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32f30c5ccca436d6",
      "translationZh": "5. 接下来做什么？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17a2dce57b025be3",
      "translationZh": "既然你已成功把 Transformers 模型转成了 ONNX，整套优化与量化工具现在都任你使用。可能的下一步有：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cb6e72714fa8a26",
      "translationZh": "用 Optimum 和 Transformers Pipelines 做 ONNX 模型的加速推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e72f3c8f107b0a9",
      "translationZh": "对模型应用静态量化，获得约 3 倍的延迟改善",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f57d53421bfdb1e",
      "translationZh": "使用 ONNX Runtime 训练",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11015b62dc5631e6",
      "translationZh": "把你的 ONNX 模型转换为 TensorRT 以提升 GPU 性能",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05c0140c68e487d7",
      "translationZh": "如果你有兴趣优化模型使其以最高效率运行，请看 🤗 Optimum 库。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02cd6ff666aad74b",
